# Remudero gate ownership is intentionally path-scoped. Once branch protection
# enables code-owner reviews, ordinary source and test changes remain autonomous;
# only the files that define or ratchet the merge gate wait for the owner.
#
# Protect this file too: GitHub recommends an owner for CODEOWNERS itself, or an
# owner could remove the safeguard in the same change that weakens the gates.
